Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:24.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信中所写何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does this letter say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想必陛下业已读过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought Your Majesty just read
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你亲口告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I asked you to tell me what this letter says,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:29.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫福德大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:41.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信中指控凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The letter accuses Queen Katherine of dissolute living
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:43.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在婚前生活放荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before she was married to Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:46.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}居于诺福克公爵遗孀宅邸期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while she was living with the Dowager Duchess of Norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.51,0:01:48.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾有两名男子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:51.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位是音乐教师亨利·麦诺士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A music teacher named Henry Manox,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:55.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一位弗朗西斯·迪尔罕先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a gentleman called Francis Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:58.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的作风人尽皆知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that her way of life was not a secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放荡不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that many knew of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:04.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁写的信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who wrote the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是封匿名信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.41,0:02:07.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}寄信人声称之所以采用如此方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoever left the letter says he only wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为他没脸当面告诉国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it because he did not have the heart to tell you by mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:11.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这肯定是凭空捏造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a forgery!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.99,0:02:16.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种指控是恶意诽谤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The accusations in this letter are maliciously intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:18.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}树大招风 难免如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many calumnies are published about well-known persons,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:19.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:21.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 陛下 - 不管怎样 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, Your Majesty. - Nevertheless, my Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我命你彻查此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I charge you to investigate the matter thoroughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:26.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}定要不惜一切代价 查个水落石出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not desist until you have reached to the bottom of the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:29.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是 陛下 - 在此期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Majesty. - In the meantime, the Queen shall be confined
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:32.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将王后软禁于寝宫 由罗彻福德女士照管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to her apartments, with only Lady Rochford in attendance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:34.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直至此事查清为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until her name is cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:36.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:38.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 告退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 给我另一只手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, the other hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:06.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卫队长 这算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sergeant? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:15.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 国王下令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady, you are confined to your apartments,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:17.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于现在起 您被软禁于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with only Lady Rochford to attend you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:19.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仅有罗彻福德女士照看您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for as long as it please the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不 - 不要 凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No! - Please, Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 琼 - 快阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Joan! - Don't let them take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Joan! Joan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:32.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么 为何待我如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? Why must I stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你告诉我 我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please tell me. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:36.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从现在开始 门外会有卫兵看守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But from now on there will be a guard posted just beyond the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:51.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·迪尔罕 你被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Francis Dereham, you are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Under arrest for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:56.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我问你 凭什么逮捕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For what, I ask you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要问你一些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to ask you some questions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.33,0:04:07.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有关几年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about what went on, some years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生在朗伯斯的一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at Lambeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时的凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between Katherine Howard, as she then was,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:14.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和这两个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and two men:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:18.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利·麦诺士和弗朗西斯·迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry Manox and Francis Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.37,0:04:22.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很清楚我在说什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what I'm talking about, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.85,0:04:38.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不必害怕 布尔默女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no need to be afraid, Mistress Bulmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:41.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要你如实相告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No harm will come to you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:43.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我便不会伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so long as you tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:46.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明白了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个叫亨利·麦诺士的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand that this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个音乐老师吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry Manox, was a music teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:05:00.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是否见过或听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you ever see him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:03.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和凯瑟琳·霍华德行过苟且之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or hear of him taking liberties with Katherine Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:08.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人 他告诉我 他爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir. He told me he was in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:10.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若是被诺福克公爵夫人发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said if my lady of Norfolk knew of the love between him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:15.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定不会同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Mistress Howard, she would undo him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为她出身贵族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because she is from a noble house,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:21.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们门不当户不对 不能成婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if you marry her, some of her blood will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:23.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那麦诺士怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what did Manox say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:26.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}管好你的嘴 傻女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He said, "Hold your peace, woman! My designs are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:31.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我欲行苟且之事 不达目的不罢休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"of a dishonest kind. I doubt not I shall achieve my purpose."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:37.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说愿献给他处女之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She said to him that he would have her maidenhead,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管初失贞洁之痛难忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}though it be painful to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:43.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但日后定能幸福圆满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}knowing he'd be good to her afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:46.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他是否拥有了她的处女之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And did he...have her maidenhead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:49.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 大人 当时她又另有所爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, sir, for she started seeing someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:55.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是弗朗西斯·迪尔罕吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And would that man be Francis Dereham?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:02.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:04.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与凯瑟琳·霍华德相识于朗伯斯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know Katherine Howard at Lambeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时她尚值及笄之年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when she was 14 or 15 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:10.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与她可曾行过男女之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you have carnal knowledge of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:17.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们玩了几次游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We-played some games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}装扮成丈夫与妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We pretended to be man and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:21.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It amused her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.91,0:06:24.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与她是否有过肌肤之亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you know her carnally?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:27.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要知道 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should know, Mr. Dereham,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:29.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已询问过一些佣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we have spoken to some of the maids
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:31.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们当时与王后同为室友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who used to sleep in the same dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:35.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们说你曾潜入王后的温床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say that you crept into the Queen's bed for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:36.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多达上百次 甚至更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a hundred nights or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:36.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她当时并非王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was not the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我再问一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.63,0:06:43.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与凯瑟琳·霍华德可曾行过男女之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you have carnal knowledge of Katherine Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:49.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:07.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为你对我极不坦诚 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you were not altogether honest with me, Mr. Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:12.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我想让你见识下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanted to show you what we do to people who are dishonest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们如何处置那些不诚不信之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who don't tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:20.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:33.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人对王后提出了某种指控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Certain accusations have been made against the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何种指控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What kind of accusations?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:40.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说她进宫之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, that she was light, immoral, dissolute...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:43.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾与某些男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with certain men...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:46.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有过轻浮 淫荡 风流之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before she came to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:54.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't believe it to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但所谓空穴不来风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But since the accusations are made,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:57.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须知晓真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must know all the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:03.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在调查已经展开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But since this inquisition is in progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你与人说话时要多加留意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be careful who you speak to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:08.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不允许有风言风语诋毁她的名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll have no spark of scandal against her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:10.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:18.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}手气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a good hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们知道了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何要如此软禁我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why have I been confined like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:31.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:37.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定说了出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone has told them something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:40.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:42.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has he told them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到底说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has he told them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如此痛哭流涕是为哪般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you crying like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:56.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事与你并无相关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:06.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得跟他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:12.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得跟陛下谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to speak to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:15.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:24.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有证据证明 凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have some evidence that Katherine Howard gave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:27.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾赠与你一条金链及一顶贵族帽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you a gold chain and rich cap, as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:32.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她为何要赠你如此贵重之礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did she buy you such gifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:38.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为当时她爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because she loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:39.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.75,0:09:41.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:43.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说过 "我发誓"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She told me: "I promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:45.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"全心全意地爱着你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I do love you with all my heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她曾以信仰和婚约为证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She promised by her faith and troth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:52.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发誓此生只愿执我之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she would take no other husband but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:53.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此说来 你们订过婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were pre-contracted then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:55.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时我们都坚信我们会成婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was understood between us that we would get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以你与她有过肌肤之亲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's why you knew her carnally?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:08.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时我们并未觉得有何不妥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We didn't think we were doing anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她将为我妻 而我将为她夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was going to be my wife and I her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们曾在上帝面前发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'd made promises before God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:17.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你为何没娶她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you not marry her, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:23.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一阵子 我离开朗伯斯去了爱尔兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I left Lambeth for a while and went to Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我回来时 凯瑟琳已在宫中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I returned, Katherine was already at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:30.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后近来将你召回 雇为她用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Queen recently took you back into her employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:32.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有何缘由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On what grounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:37.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}公爵夫人心地善良 对我的才能赞赏有加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dowager Duchess was kind enough to speak highly of my talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:40.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你承认在王后嫁给国王之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have admitted to the fact that you had carnal knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:42.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾与她有过肌肤之亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the Queen before her marriage to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他们成婚后 你与她可否还有过不轨之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But did you also know her carnally afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:47.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 大人 我以名誉担保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, sir! No! On my honour!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:50.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你何来名誉 迪尔罕先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On your honour, Mr. Dereham?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:00.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:03.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大使大人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Excellency is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:12.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤斯塔斯 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eustace! Please, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:14.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:15.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您真是慷慨热情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are too gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:20.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宫中有些谣传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are many rumours at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来王后已被软禁在她的寝宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it seems the Queen has been confined to her apartments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:33.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无人知晓 但谣传是因她行为不检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody knows. But the rumours speak of her misconduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}果然不出所料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:37.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就知道她一直都是个轻浮的小淫娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I knew she was always a light young woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:39.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终日只知寻欢作乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}dedicated only to pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}悲哀的是 玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the sad fact is, Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:43.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍华德家族都是虔诚的天主教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the Howards are a great Catholic family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.65,0:11:45.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 尤斯塔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Eustace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:47.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}悲哀的是 凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the sad fact is that Katherine Howard was never
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:51.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从来就不是虔诚的天主教徒 也绝非贤妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a good Catholic, nor ever a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:54.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更不配为后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor even less a Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:56.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有何发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you discovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:12:00.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·霍华德是个荡妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine Howard was a loose young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:03.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明明早就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You surely knew that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:06.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只听说她受非传统教育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was told that her upbringing had been unconventional.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:08.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并不知道有多不传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't know how unconventional.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.47,0:12:10.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没想到她十四岁时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't suspect that at fourteen years old
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:11.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就与两个男人初尝云雨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she was sleeping with two older men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:13.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也见过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You met her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:17.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧她那魅惑的眼神 清白才怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You saw the look in her eyes. She was never innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:21.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这世道还有谁是清白的呢 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who is innocent, my sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:25.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迪尔罕招认了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did Dereham confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:29.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只承认他在王后婚前曾与她有过肌肤之亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only that he'd slept with the Queen before she was married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:31.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you believe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.35,0:12:34.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道 我得再问一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. I may ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:42.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫君 您要当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Husband, you must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别忘了 当时正是是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you remember, you were among those
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:46.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把凯瑟琳·霍华德献给国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who offered Katherine Howard up to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:49.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以为我不记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you suppose I ever forget that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:52.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我比其他人都要生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's why I must be harder on her than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:55.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我是被骗的最惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since I was the most deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:59.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得去休息了 白天还要干活儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must to bed. I have things to do in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:03.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我祝愿你们 你们三人 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bid thee, all three of thee, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:14.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:19.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 给你的孩子取什么名字好呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what shall we call your child, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:34.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Edward
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能告诉我发生什么事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can you not tell me what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了 没人向我透露半点风声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you. No one tells me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:42.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 求求你了 - 王后 我不能和您说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Please... please... - Madam, I am forbidden to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:44.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 你必须告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no. You must speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 不行 那会掉脑袋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, I can't... On my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:48.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就说一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为何被囚于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why am I confined here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:52.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出现了什么流言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has anyone said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:00.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们已将迪尔罕收监\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have taken Dereham to the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.43,0:14:04.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也抓了公爵遗孀身边的几个侍女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also some of the maids who attended the Dowager Duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:08.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh... my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:10.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所知仅止于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:13.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后 恕臣失礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, Madam, you will have to excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:16.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只能言尽于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.30,0:14:26.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.09,0:14:28.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:31.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:15:00.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:04.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:07.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫福德大人和其他议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my Lord Hertford, and other Councillors,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:10.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对王后通奸一案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have made diligent inquiries
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:15.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已进行勤力调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into the question of the misconduct of the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}结果如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.07,0:15:19.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不得不禀告陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to tell Your Majesty that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:25.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然只是初步调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even from my preliminary investigations,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:28.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们相信 对于凯瑟琳王后的指证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we believe the allegations against Queen Katherine
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:31.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证据确凿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have a sound basis in fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.69,0:15:35.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后与诺福克公爵的遗孀同住时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Queen received the attentions of her music master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:39.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}引起其音乐教师亨利·麦诺士的关注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry Manox, when she lived with the Dowager Duchess of Norfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:44.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}麦诺士发誓王后并未对自己献身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Manox swears under oath that she never gave him her maidenhead...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:49.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但与王后有染的人名叫弗朗西斯·迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but that instead it was given to a man called Francis Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:52.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有足够的证据证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is ample proof that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们曾多次共度良宵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they spent many nights together...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}裸裎相对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:02.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迪尔罕称他曾与王后有过婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dereham claims that he was pre-contracted to the Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:06.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以与其亲热无可厚非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so he did no wrong by having carnal relations with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:08.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后来这段关系也随着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that their relationship was over when he left
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:12.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他去爱尔兰以及王后进宫而结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for Ireland and the Queen for Your Majesty's court.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:16.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:19.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后又将这个迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Queen Katherine took this same Dereham
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:23.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在陛下繁忙之时召回王庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}back into her employment during Your Majesty's late progress,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:29.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并任命她为私人文书和侍从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}appointing him her personal secretary and usher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:35.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不得不说 她心中对陛下已是不忠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to say that she has betrayed you in thought
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若非受时机所限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and if she had an opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许已然令陛下蒙羞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would have betrayed you in deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:02.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:07.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:10.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后 我来向您宣旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, I have come to tell you that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:12.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您犯了欺君之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your offences against the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的一切物品将被抄没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all your household has been discharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:18.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的财产和箱柜将被查封和看管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your coffers and chests will be sealed and placed under guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:20.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来此还要没收您的珠宝首饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I am also come here to collect all your jewels
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将其归还国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and return them to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:24.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯大人 求你别这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, Sir Thomas... Everything in here is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:27.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下在哪儿 我要见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where is the King? I must see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:30.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后 我必须告诉您 鉴于您的罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, I must tell you that the King and his Council
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:33.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王和议会已商定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have ordained that, for your offences,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撤销您的王后封号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have forfeited the title of Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:38.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}降为凯瑟琳·霍华德夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and must be known as Lady Katherine Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您今天将被遣往希昂教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be taken to Syon Abbey today,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若无国王旨意不得回宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to wait upon the King's further pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:46.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:50.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不明白 我要和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't understand. I have to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:53.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谈过就没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:56.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道吗 只要谈过就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you understand? Everything will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.52,0:17:59.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下在小教堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His Majesty is at Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:02.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但恐怕他不想和你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I fear he will not speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:13.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:17.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 拦住她 来人啊 - 凯瑟琳·霍华德 站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Stop her! Guards! - Katherine Howard! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:20.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·霍华德 站住 你被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine Howard! Stop! You are arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}站住 别再跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop! Do not proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:24.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 凯瑟琳·霍华德 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Katherine Howard! - Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:28.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要和你谈谈 求求你了 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must speak to you. Please, please, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:32.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我啊 是凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, it's me... Katherine! It's Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:36.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是凯瑟琳啊 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's Katherine. Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry! Henry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:41.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:46.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利 不 救救我 亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry! No, please! Please, Henry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:49.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:57.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莱斯利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Risley. Risley!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:58.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去请加德纳主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go and fetch Bishop Gardiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:04.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我有话对他说 - 是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I must speak to him. - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:17.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么这么对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:19.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经都招了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've already told you everything I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:22.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抓住他的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His hands, my loves. His hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:26.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要干什么 不要 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you going to do to me? No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:29.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:31.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:33.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须告诉您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must warn Your Grace
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:42.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自从这可怜的女子来到此处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the poor creature, ever since she came here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便一直痛哭流涕 抑郁悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has been in such lamentation and heaviness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:47.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未见过有人如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I never saw in any creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:50.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时她会陷入疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes in a frenzy, that I had
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:53.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不得不卸下可能会伤害到她的器具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to remove every implement that might have harmed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:20:00.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:07.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳女士 加德纳主教来看望你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Katherine! Bishop Gardiner is come to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:12.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:21.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳女士 莫要悲泣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Katherine, do not weep,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:24.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我带来了陛下的手谕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I am come here with a letter from His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:28.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}承蒙皇恩浩荡 你已获得宽大处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which offers you his most gracious mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.51,0:20:34.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士 国王已宽谅于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, the King offers you mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:42.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:48.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是陛下的手谕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here is His Majesty's letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:52.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谕中明示 不管你曾经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In it, he offers you mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:58.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做过何等奸龊欺君之事 陛下均可宽谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}despite the...uh...grievous offences you have committed against him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:03.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要你能如实供认你的罪责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you will only openly confess your faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:06.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里 看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:10.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贱妾恭谢 吾王隆恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I humbly thank the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:13.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下对贱妾 宽厚慈德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who has shown me more grace and mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:16.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恩重如山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than I could have hoped for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:20.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但首先 我得问你几个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, first, I must ask you some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:25.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同在审判之日供认一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you must answer as truthfully and honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:28.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须如实作答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you will reply at the Day of Judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.81,0:21:39.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:43.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下既已对你宽怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King offers his hand in mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:46.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便无须再如此惶乱不堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is nothing to be frightened of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:49.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静 坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come. Come! Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:14.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吾主隆恩 赐妾得以偷生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas, my Lord, that I am alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:19.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惶念死亡恐惧的悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fear of death does not grieve me as much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:23.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}远不及愧念罪失君宠的悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the remembrance of the King's goodness,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:30.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤念及妾身怀有王子之时所受万般宠幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for when I remember how gracious and loving a Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:34.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不禁泪雨潸然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had, I cannot but sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.28,0:22:41.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贱妾本自知罪无可恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But this sudden mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:44.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今日竟幸得陛下宽谅之恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}more than I could have looked for,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.35,0:22:46.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}念及往日种种 欺君失德之行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}makes my offences appear to my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贱妾倍感悔恨 无地自容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}more heinous than they did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:15.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你承认与弗朗西斯·迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You confess that this Francis Dereham came
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.75,0:23:18.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾在朗伯斯常私会你于闺中吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}often to your bed at Lambeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:23.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 主教大人 他来与我共寝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, my Lord. He has lain with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:26.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时而衣冠整齐 时而一丝不挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sometimes in his doublet and hose, and sometimes naked,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:30.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的意思是 并非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I mean, not so naked
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.07,0:23:32.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一丝不挂而来 常是衣冠整齐而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he had nothing upon him, for he had always
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随后便脱得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his doublet on; but I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.21,0:23:38.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一丝不挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}naked when his hose was pulled down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:41.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是为了满足你们的肉欲吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In order to know you carnally?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.23,0:23:48.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们之间可有婚约在先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was there a pre-contract between you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.29,0:23:51.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你曾有意要嫁给他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you intend to marry him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:56.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我们在一起的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sometimes called me "Wife" When we were together,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.64,0:23:59.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也曾以"夫妻"相称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I called him "Husband."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:02.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而我认为那并非婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Still... I think it was no contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.43,0:24:04.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你们之间存有婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If there was a contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么你和陛下的婚姻便无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then your marriage to the King would be invalid
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.97,0:24:10.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你虽然会背负失德之耻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you might face shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.56,0:24:13.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不会有性命之忧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but you would not forfeit your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:19.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他虽许诺会爱我一生一世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He promised to love me with all his heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.65,0:24:24.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍觉得那不代表婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I think it was no contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.99,0:24:29.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你成为王后以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did Dereham have carnal knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:32.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迪尔罕可曾再与你偷欢寻情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of you after you became Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.17,0:24:35.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 主教大人 从未有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, my Lord. He never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.86,0:24:44.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我即刻动身返往伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will go back to London and draft
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:47.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为你起草一份求情书呈交陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a plea of forgiveness for you to submit to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.86,0:24:54.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.80,0:24:57.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我仍有要事未说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have important things to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:25:00.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.43,0:25:04.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未同意与迪尔罕发生肉体关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never consented to sex with Francis Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.14,0:25:09.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他再三纠缠 逼我就范的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He used importunate force against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.05,0:25:14.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用暴力的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a manner-violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.07,0:25:17.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他强暴了你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He raped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:24.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后招供了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Queen confessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.30,0:25:28.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 她说迪尔罕强暴了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. She told me that Dereham raped her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:29.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同她所做的其他供述一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure she was lying as
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:31.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这件事上 无疑她也撒了谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure she's lying about other things too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.11,0:25:35.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我相信他们之前确实有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I do believe that there was some form of pre-contract
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:39.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种形式的婚约 这样她与陛下的婚姻便属无效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between them, which would invalidate the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:42.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也声称自己婚后一直洁身自好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she claims to be innocent after the marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.09,0:25:43.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她当然那样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.17,0:25:45.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you believed that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:47.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.14,0:25:50.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反正我对迪尔罕所说的一概不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't believe anything Dereham says.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.44,0:25:54.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许不是和迪尔罕呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It might not be Dereham.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.43,0:25:57.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人何出此言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why does Your Grace say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.40,0:25:59.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你拿到王后的供词了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have the Queen's confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.63,0:26:03.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.43,0:26:06.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后恳请陛下开恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Queen begs for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:09.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她供认自己由于贪享陛下的恩宠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She confesses that she was so desirous to be taken
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:12.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沉迷王室的富贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into Your Grace's favour, so blinded
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.94,0:26:15.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窥图权柄的伟力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by desire for worldly glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.11,0:26:18.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而丧没了心智 惘顾了隐瞒旧情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that she did not consider how great a fault it was
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.41,0:26:22.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欺君罔上 是何等大罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to conceal her former faults from Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.41,0:26:26.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虑及妾曾决意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Considering that I intended
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:28.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倾此一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Ever during my life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:30.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对陛下忠贞诚实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"To be faithful and true to Your Majesty."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.35,0:26:33.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我们能够废免她的身份了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we can proceed with the annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.18,0:26:36.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}臣认为此举甚妥 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think it would be best, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.78,0:26:39.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不相信你在王后入宫之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't believe that you didn't have carnal knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.38,0:26:41.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未曾与其苟且偷情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the Queen after her marriage to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:44.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要 我说的都是实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't! It is the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.07,0:26:48.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实因已有他人溺卧于王后闺帏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because someone else had succeeded me in her affections.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.37,0:26:53.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.50,0:26:55.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:01.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·卡尔佩珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.45,0:27:05.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·卡尔佩珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas Culpepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.01,0:27:07.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王的侍从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King's groom?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.07,0:27:11.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.82,0:27:18.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对托马斯·卡尔佩珀熟悉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How well did you know this man, Thomas Culpepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:22.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相当熟悉 我曾与他嬉闹耍笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quite well. I flirted with him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.28,0:27:26.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并常在后梯处与他会面 还送过礼物给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and met him sometimes by the back stairs, and gave him gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.89,0:27:29.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他唤我作"可爱的小傻瓜"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He called me his "Sweet little fool."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:36.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可与他行过苟且之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And did you commit adultery with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:43.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 大人 绝未有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, my Lord. I never did
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.86,0:27:49.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管罗彻福德女士曾鼓动我就范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}although Lady Rochford encouraged me to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:55.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗彻福德女士鼓动过你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford encouraged you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.01,0:27:58.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 她做过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.48,0:28:01.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后她便散播这卑鄙的谣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then she spread a vile rumour
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:03.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诬蔑说我们是爱侣 我们根本不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we were lovers, which we never were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.89,0:28:06.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你承认你曾多次暗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't deny that you met with the Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:09.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 偷会王后 - 是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- in secret on many occasions? - No, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.43,0:28:11.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你否认与她通奸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you deny that you ever committed adultery with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.76,0:28:15.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我们从未逾越言语交流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do. We never passed beyond words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.93,0:28:19.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你不说实话 卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you don't tell me the truth, Mr. Culpepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:22.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会被施以酷刑 直至你招认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will be tortured till you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.15,0:28:24.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说的是实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.61,0:28:26.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也想有进一步发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which isn't to say I didn't want to go further!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.72,0:28:30.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也想要与王后通奸 她也想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I intended and meant to do so with the Queen, and she with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.52,0:28:34.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.80,0:28:38.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}光有这邪念就够得上叛国罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That evil intent in itself constitutes high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.15,0:28:44.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那是凯瑟琳引诱我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it was Katherine who led me on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:47.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是她想这样 不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She wanted it, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.95,0:28:51.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有她的侍女 罗彻福德夫人 是她策划的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And her servant, Lady Rochford, she provoked it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.05,0:28:55.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是她穿针引线 像那种妓院的老鸨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and acted as a procuress, like some madam in a brothel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.87,0:28:58.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他们都指责我 这不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are they blaming me? It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.80,0:29:02.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们在王后的卧室幽会时 我得在外面望风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had to stand guard when they met in the Queen's chambers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.88,0:29:05.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至在她的厕所外望风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or even her stool closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.47,0:29:07.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.88,0:29:10.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't like doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.27,0:29:15.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一次我不得不阻止国王进入王后的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once I even had to stop the King coming into the Queen's bedchamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.87,0:29:19.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为卡尔佩珀已经在里边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because Culpepper was already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.08,0:29:24.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为他们有没有发生肉体关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think they had carnal knowledge at those times?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:28.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从他们的眉目传情间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot think it otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:33.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}答案毫无疑问是肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}considering all the things I heard and saw between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.86,0:29:39.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卫兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.21,0:29:45.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得我会死吗 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think I shall die, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:49.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得我会死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think I shall die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.18,0:29:54.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卫兵 开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Constable! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.66,0:30:01.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下在调查之初就指示我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Majesty asked me at the beginning of this investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:05.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不到水落石出不可罢手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not to desist until I had got to the bottom of the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.41,0:30:15.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 恐怕我已触到真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, I fear to say that I am already scraping the bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:19.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下您的一位好伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a good companion of Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.32,0:30:21.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您信任的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a fellow of trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.59,0:30:25.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来已背叛了陛下您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}seems certain to have betrayed Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:29.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}犯下了与王后 您的妻子通奸的大罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}committing adultery with the Queen, your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.97,0:30:34.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.41,0:30:40.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的侍从官 托马斯·卡尔佩珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your groom, Thomas Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.32,0:30:50.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迄今为止 他们二人均否认此项控告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So far, both of them have denied the charges,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.19,0:30:53.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他们都未否认曾密会多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}though neither of them denies the many illicit meetings
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.66,0:30:56.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们在随同陛下上次出访期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they had on the backstairs and in the Queen's stool closet
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.75,0:30:59.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾在后楼梯及王后的卫生间密会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}during Your Majesty's last progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.27,0:31:04.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗彻福德夫人及其他几名王后陛下的侍女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford and other maids of Her Majesty have
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:07.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}均自愿提供物证以证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}come forward with corroborating evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.99,0:31:11.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们之间有多次亲密接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of their frequent intimacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.34,0:31:19.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有 这封信是在卡尔佩珀的房间内搜到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finally, this letter was discovered in Mr. Culpepper's chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:23.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是王后的笔迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the Queen's handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.53,0:31:26.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她写道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She writes:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.71,0:31:28.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每每想起你不能常伴左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"It makes my heart die to think
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.07,0:31:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我便心碎不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I cannot always be in your company."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.71,0:31:35.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听闻您抱恙在身 恨不得胁下生翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, "I heard that you were sick and never longed so much
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.19,0:31:38.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不顾一切见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for anything as to see you."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.33,0:31:42.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下面署名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it is signed:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.86,0:31:45.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你至死不渝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Yours as long as life endures
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.96,0:31:47.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Katherine."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.49,0:31:53.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一切都是你们的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has happened is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.97,0:31:55.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.59,0:31:58.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你挑唆我娶了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You solicited me to marry her!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.81,0:32:05.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎会如此不幸 这般娶妻不慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How misfortunate I am to have had so many ill-conditioned wives!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.10,0:32:08.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓 不管那下作的贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I vow that any pleasure that wicked bitch got from
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.34,0:32:11.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从淫乱中获得何种乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her wantonness will be nothing-nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:14.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都抵不上我对她施之酷刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in comparison to the pain she going to feel
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:16.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所带来痛苦的万分之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the hand of my torturer!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.70,0:32:37.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}辛苦了 夫人 我们给他起什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well done, wife. What shall we call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.26,0:32:41.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.16,0:32:46.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 就托马斯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well. Thomas he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.63,0:32:59.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您还要继续审问罗彻福德夫人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to ask Lady Rochford some more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:02.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 没必要了 托马斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes. - There's no point, Sir Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:05.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗彻福德夫人疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady Rochford has gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.84,0:33:08.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Death to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.66,0:33:17.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们在这儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.65,0:33:31.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 萨福克公爵大人到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty? His Grace, the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.45,0:33:36.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从不读圣经 是不是 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've never read the Bible, have you, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:40.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下 我总让那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Your Majesty. I've always allowed others,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.18,0:33:43.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比我更博学的人来念给我听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with more knowledge than I, to read it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:46.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说来 你错过了许多警句格言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In that case, you've missed many great sayings and truths,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.78,0:33:50.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像所罗门卷里的这段 这里说道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like this one here in the Book of Solomon, where it says:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.22,0:33:54.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}妓女的嘴唇犹如蜂蜜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The lips of a harlot are "a dropping honeycomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.58,0:33:58.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的喉咙柔软赛油脂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Her throat is softer than oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.52,0:34:01.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可到最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Yet in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.58,0:34:04.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她却苦如苦艾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"she is as bitter as wormwood,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.12,0:34:06.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}锋利赛过双韧之剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and as sharp as a double-edged sword."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.10,0:34:08.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所来何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.97,0:34:12.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王送来一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King Francis has sent you a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.87,0:34:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信上怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.39,0:34:25.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得闻王后淫邪不齿之行径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I am sorry to hear of the displeasure and trouble which has been
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.70,0:34:29.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所招致的不快与纷乱 我深表遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}caused "by the lewd and naughty behaviour of the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.45,0:34:34.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但深知我兄乃英明审慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"But knowing my good brother to be a prince of prudence,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.79,0:34:36.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正直高尚之君王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}virtue, and honour,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.51,0:34:39.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希冀陛下 摆脱上述不快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I do require him to throw off the said displeasure
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.29,0:34:43.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明智而适度地 一如我这般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and wisely, temperately, like myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:46.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勿需将您的荣耀置于女子的轻浮之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"not reputing his honour to rest in the lightness of a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.02,0:34:48.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而应置于上帝所赐之福祉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"but to thank God of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.38,0:34:50.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感激上帝仁慈所赐之安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"comforting himself in God's goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.94,0:34:55.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女子之轻浮无法损毁男人之荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The lightness of women cannot bend the honour of men."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.90,0:34:57.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让弗朗西斯见鬼去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tell Francis to go
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.83,0:35:02.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉法王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell His Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.53,0:35:05.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对他的恳请不胜感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we are grateful for his solicitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.15,0:35:07.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.30,0:35:08.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迪尔罕和卡尔佩珀如何了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of Dereham and Culpepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.50,0:35:10.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们被控叛国了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have they been arraigned for treason?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.06,0:35:12.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们两人一同被审\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were tried together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.24,0:35:16.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后一刻 卡尔佩珀改口承认有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the last moment, Culpepper changed his plea to guilty,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.60,0:35:18.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但两人都被判有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but both were found so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:23.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们被判在泰伯恩刑场施以绞刑 开膛和分尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are due to be hanged, drawn and quartered together at Tyburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.27,0:35:27.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉法官对卡尔佩珀减刑为斩首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell the judge to commute Culpepper's sentencing to beheading.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.30,0:35:30.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那迪尔罕更可恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate Dereham more,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.54,0:35:33.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为是他把王后姑息成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since he spoiled the Queen for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.30,0:35:37.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那罗彻福德夫人怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, what of Lady Rochford?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.75,0:35:42.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她被查出犯有渎职与叛国之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has been found guilty of misprision and treason
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.03,0:35:46.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 鉴于她已精神失常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but, since she is insane,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.28,0:35:48.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不能处以极刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she cannot be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.55,0:35:53.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即刻让理查·李希在议会通过一项法案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tell Richard Rich to pass a bill in Parliament
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:56.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}允许处决犯有叛国罪的疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}making it legal to execute an insane person for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.25,0:35:58.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}清楚了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.14,0:36:04.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.10,0:36:17.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朕错娶凯瑟琳·霍华德 你也难辞其咎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were one of those who placed Katherine Howard in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.59,0:36:19.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此话不为过吧 公爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were you not, your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.31,0:36:24.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可有悔意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.71,0:36:30.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退下吧 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.81,0:36:34.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告退 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.10,0:37:19.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们这些毫无廉耻的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should be ashamed of yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:22.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卖国贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.48,0:37:24.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"卡尔佩珀大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Master Culpepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.23,0:37:27.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我多想委身于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I heartily recommend me unto you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.01,0:37:30.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又不知君心何意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"praying you to send me word how that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.79,0:37:32.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听闻你抱恙在身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I heard that you were sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.55,0:37:36.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恨不得胁下生翼 不顾一切见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and never longed so much for anything as to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.28,0:37:42.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若你此时在我身旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I would you were with me now that you might see
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.04,0:37:45.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便知我柔肠寸断 泣难下笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"what pain I take in writing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.35,0:37:49.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每每想起你不能常伴左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"It makes my heart die to think
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.13,0:37:52.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我便心碎不已"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I cannot always be in your company."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:05.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳请诸位为我祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you all to pray for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.30,0:38:23.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迪尔罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"He, Dereham,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.94,0:38:26.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他赠予我许多爱的信物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"gave me lots of lovers' tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.11,0:38:29.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他熟识一位伦敦的驼背小妇人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"He knew a little woman in London with a crooked back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.15,0:38:33.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那妇人精通用丝绸制作花卉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"who was skilled in making flowers of silk,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.44,0:38:37.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他请那妇人做了法国茴香 并赠送与我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"who made for him a French fennel to give to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:40.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此后 新年时我又收到了心安草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"And later, a Heart's ease for a New Year's present,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.46,0:38:43.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一些薄绸 我拿来做了顶帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and some sarcenet, which I had made into a quilted cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.41,0:38:48.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他一边唤我"爱妻"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"He called me "wife,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.70,0:38:52.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一边抚摸我身体的私处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and touched the secret parts of my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.98,0:39:07.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得曾回赠他衬衫的领和袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I remember I gave him a collar and sleeves for a shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.14,0:39:09.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"And one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.41,0:39:12.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他抢走了我的一只银手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"he snatched a silver bracelet from me and kept it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.36,0:39:15.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后说 "爱妻 谢谢你的礼物"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"saying, Here, wife, a gift for me."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.03,0:39:20.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他常常热烈地激吻我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"And he kissed me often and so passionately
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.03,0:39:24.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人人都说 他吻我多少次都不会厌倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"that everyone said he would never have kissed me enough."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.08,0:39:54.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.23,0:39:59.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.40,0:40:31.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine Howard,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:33.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的婚前生活糜烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are indicted for having led an abominable,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.81,0:40:36.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卑劣 淫荡 放纵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}base, carnal, voluptuous,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.39,0:40:40.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伤风败俗 与多人淫乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and vicious life before marriage like a common harlot
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.40,0:40:42.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}堪比人尽可夫的娼妓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with several persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.03,0:40:44.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你以言行蛊惑 骗得国王宠幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You led the King by word and gesture to love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.60,0:40:46.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}隐瞒曾与弗朗西斯·迪尔罕交往之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}concealing your contract with Francis Dereham
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.17,0:40:50.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}严重威胁到王室血脉之纯正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the peril of the King and his children begotten by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.40,0:40:52.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}婚后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And after marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.51,0:40:56.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对迪尔罕格外关照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you showed the same Dereham notable favour,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.85,0:41:01.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时勾引托马斯·卡尔佩珀 行苟且之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while inciting Thomas Culpepper to carnal knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.07,0:41:03.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还对他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}telling him
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.31,0:41:06.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你爱他胜过爱国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you loved him above the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.68,0:41:12.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来此带你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is my duty
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.77,0:41:15.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前往伦敦塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to escort you to the Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.36,0:41:23.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.22,0:41:28.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.37,0:41:30.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请别让他们带我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:44.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.48,0:42:15.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.85,0:42:19.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.60,0:42:24.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.17,0:42:27.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My Lady. - No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.36,0:42:31.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天啊 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no! No, No! No, Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.44,0:42:39.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她被定罪了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is she condemned?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.91,0:42:41.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.42,0:42:44.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.08,0:42:47.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迪尔罕和卡尔佩珀被判处极刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dereham and Culpepper have been executed
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.20,0:42:51.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法案已经议会通过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the bill allowing a mad person to be executed
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.26,0:42:53.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}允许处死犯有叛国罪的疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for treason has become law.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.89,0:43:01.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要开个宴会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to have a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.53,0:43:03.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是受邀宾客名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here is a list of guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.81,0:43:05.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.04,0:43:53.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·霍华德 你已被判处死刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Katherine Howard, I have to tell you that you are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.66,0:43:55.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明早 即二月十三日清晨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will be taken to your place of execution tomorrow morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.82,0:43:59.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将由枢密院派人押赴刑场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the 13th of February, escorted by members of the Privy Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.29,0:44:08.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以提个要求吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask one favour?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.28,0:44:14.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可否给我一个垫头木\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you bring the block to me
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.85,0:44:17.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想知道该如何摆放身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that I might know how to place myself
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.23,0:44:22.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想熟悉一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and... make trial of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.82,0:44:25.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如你所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.29,0:44:27.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有其它需要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there anything else you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.63,0:44:29.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要忏悔牧师吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you want a confessor?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.61,0:44:33.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.38,0:44:36.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很少对神祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have spoken to God so rarely,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.99,0:44:40.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕他并不认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not think He would know who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.97,0:45:05.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:32.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来点甜点吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.84,0:45:53.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得怎样 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think? Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.05,0:46:03.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}美丽的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! A beautiful Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.00,0:48:08.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 有何遗言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam. Do you want to say a few words?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.08,0:48:19.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳请仁慈的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask forgiveness for my sins,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.55,0:48:23.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳请神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from His Gracious Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.17,0:48:27.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳请在场各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from God,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.56,0:48:32.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宽恕我的罪过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and from all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:40.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还能再说几句吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I say more?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.44,0:48:43.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 夫人 已经够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, my Lady. That is already sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.49,0:48:47.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.71,0:50:02.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时辰到了 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's time, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.56,0:50:23.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来此受死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have come here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.22,0:50:24.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.91,0:50:29.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我虽身为王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I die a Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.26,0:50:34.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但宁愿以卡尔佩珀妻子的身份死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I would rather die the wife of Culpepper...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.28,0:51:03.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生命何其美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Life is very beautiful.
